Apple has started bumping up estimated delivery dates for some customers who pre-ordered the <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/iphone-duo/">iPhone Duo</a> in countries such as the U.S. and Japan.<br/>
<br/>
<img src="https://images.macrumors.com/article-new/2026/10/Apple-iPhone-Duo-Early-Feature-Rejected.jpg" alt="" width="2500" height="1406" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-1071670" /><br/>
In the U.S., for example, well-known YouTuber <a href="https://www.youtube.com/mattgonzalez">Matt Gonzalez</a> today <a href="https://x.com/mattdgonzalez/status/2112247079833895142">said</a> his iPhone Duo pre-order initially showed a December delivery estimate, but Apple's online store now shows him an earlier delivery estimate of between November 20 and November 30. He ordered a Star White model with 512GB of storage.<br/>
<br/>
A <a href="https://forums.macrumors.com/threads/usa-iphone-duo-pre-order-ship-delivery-pick-up-18-pro-pro-max-thread-merged.2488745/page-149?post=34881425#post-34881425">handful</a> <a href="https://forums.macrumors.com/threads/usa-iphone-duo-pre-order-ship-delivery-pick-up-18-pro-pro-max-thread-merged.2488745/page-149?post=34881541#post-34881541">of</a> <a href="https://forums.macrumors.com/threads/usa-iphone-duo-pre-order-ship-delivery-pick-up-18-pro-pro-max-thread-merged.2488745/page-148?post=34881367#post-34881367">other</a> <a href="https://forums.macrumors.com/threads/usa-iphone-duo-pre-order-ship-delivery-pick-up-18-pro-pro-max-thread-merged.2488745/page-148?post=34881355#post-34881355">customers</a> have seen their iPhone Duo delivery estimates <a href="https://forums.macrumors.com/threads/any-other-11-2-11-9-people-obsessively-checking-the-app-to-see-if-you-got-bumped-up.2492020/">bumped up by weeks</a>, according to comments shared by MacRumors Forums members in the <a href="https://forums.macrumors.com/threads/usa-iphone-duo-pre-order-ship-delivery-pick-up-18-pro-pro-max-thread-merged.2488745/">U.S. pre-order thread</a> for the device. For example, a pair of customers with an initial December 1 to December 8 delivery estimate are now seeing November 16 to November 23.<br/>
